Use the distributor ID to select the ARM GIC interface

A zero GIC CPU feature field sent a GICv3 guest down the legacy MMIO path and left its virtual timer interrupt pending. Select the system-register interface when the distributor ID confirms GICv3 or GICv4 and share that decision with the platform driver.

